                                "sense_id": "ff888488-449e-3e31-9db1-db31b91b48fb",
                                "text": "The White Hart, overlooking the bridge, has a bar named after the coracles that may still be seen on this part of the Teifi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
